{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54442","headline":"送人归新罗 · 陈光","name":"送人归新罗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巨浸隔乡关，离城日已残。\n日将程共远，风与浪争难。\n岸尽霞光落，天光海色寒。\n扶桑归到後，万里梦长安。\n（同前第六册第四三八二页）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54442.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54442","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}